# A whole game as the Union side, which only ends each turn; the computer plays the Rebel side, on the alternate map.
# A digest at each of the 5 main menus, at Game Over and at the title menus.
# Written by tests/make_scripts.py.
#! seed 1865
#! cfg side=1 history=1
#! altmap
#! files cws.his HISCORE.CWS
#! timeout 900

# Pauses that any key ends; End Turn and End Game: Yes; a Retreat: the first city; the
# Options at the game's end: Quit this Game.
rule 1 key space
rule 2:E text y
rule 2:R key enter
rule 2:O text q

# The title menu: Start NEW Game.
play until 2:V
digest
text s

# Each month's main menu: a digest, then END TURN.
repeat 5
play until 2:M
digest
text e
end

# The game ends. The Hall of Fame asks for the commander's name.
play until 4
text Tester
key enter
play until 1:G
digest
key space

# The title menu: Quit to DOS, and a key for END's "Press any key to continue".
play until 2:V
digest
text q
repeat space
